[{"answer":"Hello, Helen. Sorry I'm late.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Hi, Jeremy, no problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Well we'd better work out where we are on our project, I suppose.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. I've looked at the drawings you've done for my story, 'The Forest',","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/4.mp3"},{"answer":"and I think they're brilliant - they really create the atmosphere I had in mind when I was writing it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm glad you like them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/6.mp3"},{"answer":"There are just a few suggestions I'd like to make.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Go ahead.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, I'm not sure about the drawing of the cave -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/9.mp3"},{"answer":"it's got trees all around it, which is great,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/10.mp3"},{"answer":"but the drawing's a bit too static, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it needs some action.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, there's nothing happening.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Perhaps I should add the boy - Malcolm, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/14.mp3"},{"answer":"He would be walking up to it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, let's have Malcolm in the drawing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/16.mp3"},{"answer":"And what about putting in a tiger -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/17.mp3"},{"answer":"the one that he makes friends with a bit later? Maybe it could be sitting under a tree washing itself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/18.mp3"},{"answer":"And the tiger stops in the middle of what it's doing when it sees Malcolm walking past.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/19.mp3"},{"answer":"That's a good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/20.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, I'll have a go at that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Then there's the drawing of the crowd of men and women dancing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/22.mp3"},{"answer":"They're just outside the forest, and there's a lot going on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/23.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right, you wanted them to be watching a carnival procession, but I thought it would be too crowded.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you think it works like this?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I like what you've done.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/26.mp3"},{"answer":"The only thing is, could you add Malcolm to it, without changing what's already there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/27.mp3"},{"answer":"What about having him sitting on the tree trunk on the right of the picture?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that would be fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/29.mp3"},{"answer":"And do you want him watching the other people?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/30.mp3"},{"answer":"No, he's been left out of all the fun, so I'd like him to be crying -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/31.mp3"},{"answer":"that'll contrast nicely with the next picture,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/32.mp3"},{"answer":"where he's laughing at the clowns in the carnival.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, I'll do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/34.mp3"},{"answer":"And then the drawing of the people ice skating in the forest.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/35.mp3"},{"answer":"I wasn't too happy with that one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Because they're supposed to be skating on grass aren't they?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/37.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right, and it's frozen over.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/38.mp3"},{"answer":"At the moment it doesn't look quite right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/39.mp3"},{"answer":"I see what you mean.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/40.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll have another go at that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/41.mp3"},{"answer":"And I like the wool hats they're wearing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe you could give each of them a scarf as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, that's easy enough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/44.mp3"},{"answer":"They can be streaming out behind the people to suggest they're skating really fast.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Well that's all on the drawings.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/48.mp3"},{"answer":"So you've finished writing your story and I just need to finish illustrating it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/49.mp3"},{"answer":"and my story and your drawings are done.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/50.mp3"},{"answer":"So the next thing is to decide what exactly we need to write about in the report that goes with the stories,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/51.mp3"},{"answer":"and how we're going to divide the work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, Helen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/53.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you think about including a section on how we planned the project as a whole, Jeremy?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/54.mp3"},{"answer":"That's probably quite important.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. Well, you've had most of the good ideas so far.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/56.mp3"},{"answer":"How do you feel about drafting something,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/57.mp3"},{"answer":"then we can go through it together and discuss it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/58.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, that seems reasonable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/59.mp3"},{"answer":"And I could include something on how we came up with the ideas for our two stories, couldn't I?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I've started writing something about that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/61.mp3"},{"answer":"so why don't you do the same and we can include the two things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/63.mp3"},{"answer":"So what about our interpretation of the stories?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Do we need to write about what we think they show,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/65.mp3"},{"answer":"like the value of helping other people, all that sort of thing?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/66.mp3"},{"answer":"That's going to come up later isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/67.mp3"},{"answer":"I think everyone in the class is going to read each other's stories","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/68.mp3"},{"answer":"and come up with their own interpretations which we're going to discuss.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I missed that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/70.mp3"},{"answer":"So it isn't going to be part of the report at all?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/71.mp3"},{"answer":"No.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/72.mp3"},{"answer":"But we need to write about the illustrations, because they're an essential element of children's experience of reading the stories.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/73.mp3"},{"answer":"It's probably easiest for you to write that section, as you know more about drawing than I do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe, but I find it quite hard to write about.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/75.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd be happier if you did it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/76.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/77.mp3"},{"answer":"So when do you think...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-3-2023-06-07-23-09-21/78.mp3"}]
